Chris — Influence: [+ chris_strength +] — Dissatisfaction: [+ chris_dissent +]%
Meg — Influence: [+ meg_strength +] — Dissatisfaction: [+ meg_dissent +]%
Stewie — Influence: [+ stewie_strength +] — Dissatisfaction: [+ stewie_dissent +]%

